  "description": "This Building Block proposes a schema representation of the OpenEO process [`ceil`](https://processes.openeo.org/#ceil) \u2014 *Round fractions up*. It models the `arguments` object of a process graph node invoking `ceil`. This is a proposed correspondence between the OpenEO process definition and an OGC Building Block schema, not a settled equivalence.\n\nThe least integer greater than or equal to the number `x`.\n\nNo-data values are passed through.\n\n## Source\n\nOpenEO Processes specification: [`ceil`](https://processes.openeo.org/#ceil) ([openeo-processes/ceil.json at 2.0.0-rc.2](https://github.com/Open-EO/openeo-processes/blob/2.0.0-rc.2/ceil.json)).\n",
